# Clay-Fired Bricks // Cosmium Kiln. As the Bricks enter Bot1 searches for a basic Plains card (an Island may not be found),
# reveals it, puts it into its hand and shuffles, and gains 2 life. On turn three that Plains is played and the Bricks craft
# with a Mox Ruby (Craft with artifact {5}{W}{W}) into Cosmium Kiln, which makes two 1/1 colorless Gnome artifact creature
# tokens as it enters; "Creatures you control get +1/+1" makes them 2/2 and Bot1's Ornithopter 1/3, and leaves Bot2's
# Ornithopter as it is.

